{"id":80717750502415,"type":"album","name":"Never for Ever","artist":"Kate Bush","year":1980,"weight":11,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/19412-never-for-ever_010857.jpg","aoty":72,"aoty_user":85,"yt":"C-p9K_Ieloo","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/kate-bush/never-for-ever","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/19412-kate-bush-never-for-ever.php"},"desc":"Never for Ever is the third studio album by English singer Kate Bush. Released in September 1980, it was Bush's first No. 1 album and was also the first album by a British female solo artist to top the UK Albums Chart, as well as being the first album by any female solo artist to enter the chart at No. 1. It has since been certified Gold by the BPI. It features the UK Top 20 singles \"Breathing\", \"Army Dreamers\" and \"Babooshka\", the latter being one of Bush's biggest hits. Bush co-produced the album with Jon Kelly. ."},"artist_ref":{"id":159942841705747,"name":"Kate Bush","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kate_Bush_Hounds_of_Love_%281985_EMI_publicity_photo%29_02_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":126030611694007,"type":"genre","name":"Art Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":310,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":258906480523511,"type":"genre","name":"Baroque Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":269,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":132119653572823,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":225,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":35507544569942,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Baroque Pop","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":5,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":199737804810861,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Progressive Pop","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":6,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":210775829953573,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Art Pop","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyo